=2 Walkthrough
Note: if your Windurst fame is level 4 or higher, you will be assigned {p:Let Sleeping Dogs Lie} instead, and cannot start this quest until after you complete that one.
* Speak to {n:Mashuu-Ajuu} who will give you a bag of {i:Herb Seeds|Herb Seeds|572} and ask you to plant them.
** **(Optional)** speak to the other students for vague tips about what can be grown from various seed types.
* You can plant the seeds and grow them into a {i:Deathball|Deathball|4566} or {i:Sobbing Fungus|Sobbing Fungus|4565}, or you can just purchase them off the {z:Auction House}.
** The Sobbing Fungas can also be bought at {n:Soupox} in {z:Leafallia} for 60 Gil.
* Trading {n:Mashuu-Ajuu} a {i:Deathball|Deathball|4566} will reward you with a {i:Stationery Set|Stationery Set|131} and 700 gil.
* Trading {n:Mashuu-Ajuu} a {i:Sobbing Fungus|Sobbing Fungus|4565} will reward you with a {i:Stationery Set|Stationery Set|131} and 500 gil.

----
* Repeat attempts will not reward the Stationery Set.
* You will not get any more Herb Seeds other than the first time.
* If you set your home point to Windurst and have the appropriate Rhapsodies Key Item, this will only cost 160 by using a BLM Warp. Profiting 340 Gil each turn-in by buying the Sobbing Fungus from Soupox.

